Z||000000||Tigger||10-21-2000||05:22 PM||||I saw a Diablo.  A Diablo, the real deal, not a kit.  Man it was "real" Red and the V12, oh sounded sweet...<P>It pulled up across from me at a stop light, stopped for a second, made a right turn, and was gone.  I didn't even hear him shift.  LOL, I don't think you even need to shift until your're up around 60mph.  <P>Hehe, I probably gave the guy a good chuckle seeing me and my Orange Fiero across the intersection.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  Awe well, hopefully I'll have a chance to race him in my Fiero one of these days.  I wonder if he'd let me win...  shoot all he'd have to do is hold the pedal down about half way to smoke me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Anyway, just wanted to share that, don't see too many Diablo's running around in Michigan.<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">           <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||2xsess||10-21-2000||05:49 PM||||That's cool,when I lived in West Palm Beach, FL I saw a lot of exotic cars but it's always exciting to see one of those sweet things rolling down the street.<P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
Z||000002||Shaun41178||10-21-2000||06:58 PM||||Hmmm I wonder if he is making a southern trek here to Toledo.  Maybe he heard of a little red GT tearing it up here and wants to take a shot at me?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||My7Fieros||10-21-2000||09:48 PM||||I actually see one or two from time to time.<BR>The owner/creator whatever of Autozone lives here, and used to have a silver Countach..dont know if he still does, but I do see him from time to time driving a red Diablo...sweet.||||reg||1
Z||000004||fierosound||10-22-2000||12:39 AM||||Just last week I saw the newest Ferrari - the Modena...   <A HREF="http://www.die-autobahn.de/f360/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.die-autobahn.de/f360/</A> <P>It came up from behind in the next lane.  I wasn't sure what it was - thought it might be a Fiero kitted up.  Once I saw the rear, I saw the Ferrari emblem, and could see that the bottom end was definitely not a Fiero cradle.  I noticed this week the Modena graces the font of several magazines.  Looks great!<P>PS - the passenger in the Modena gave MY FIERO a good look as they went by - I was turning off heading for home.  Should I have given them a run with my new 3.4L??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 10-22-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||10-22-2000||07:24 AM||||Although I'm sure your new 3.4 is fast, I'm guessing that all you'd see is taillights (waaay in the distance) if you tried to race him.  I'm pretty sure that one of the options on the 360 Modena are wings.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 10-22-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cheever2||10-22-2000||07:47 AM||||I don't think the Modena would want to tangle with the Diablo.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Seanh||10-22-2000||08:54 AM||||If you did race them, Im sure they would have been suprised at the power this little car with a 3.4 could put out. Although they probally could have blown your doors off, you could have kept up better then most. Plus you tell everyone how you "almost" beat a Modena.<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
Z||000008||Standard||10-23-2000||03:30 AM||||Actually, the Modena doesn't have any wings.  Ferrari spent long hours in the wind tunnel to get a body shape that would provide down force without the use of any wings/spoilers.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 151,000 miles and counting!         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">      <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif"> ||||reg||1
